---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../components/EnquiryForm.astro';
---
<Base title="Book a 30-minute architecture review | Prodory" description="A free 30-minute architecture review: your current state, risks and options, in writing." path="/architecture-review/">
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[2fr_3fr]">
    <div>
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-muted"><a href="/">Home</a> / Architecture review</nav>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Book a 30-minute architecture review</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted">Tell us what you run today and what is driving the change. We reply within one working day with a time to talk.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-8 font-semibold">What the 30 minutes covers</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-sm text-muted">
        <li>Your current estate and the constraint that matters most (cost, compliance, lock-in or capacity)</li>
        <li>Which of our four services fits, or whether you need us at all</li>
        <li>What we would need to see before a written proposal</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted">No sales script. If we are not the right team, we say so on the call.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-line p-6">
      <EnquiryForm id="enquiry-architecture-review" defaultCategory="general" submit="Request my review" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
